# ============================================================================
# SUPABASE CONFIGURATION (Client-Side Public Environment Variables)
# ============================================================================
# These keys are safe for the client browser (Vite exposes VITE_* prefixes).
# Get them from your Supabase Dashboard -> Project Settings -> API.
#
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL: Your project URL (e.g., https://your-project.supabase.co)
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=""

# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY: Your project public "anon" API key
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=""

# NOTE ON SERVICE ROLE KEY (SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY):
# NEVER place SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY in this file or anywhere in the client code!
# The service role key is strictly managed inside Supabase Edge Function secrets
# (automatically injected as Deno.env.get("SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY")).
